"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think the analysis of the problem is wrong. It's not that `Variant` is inherently missing, it's that variant is called `Nil` in the variant type enum names (I think `Variant::NIL` is supposed to be GDScripts `Variant` but if someone more knowledgeable could confirm this it would be great). In completion it appears under that name:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"505\" height=\"64\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8612161f-2522-4943-8efc-1e2c644421d4\" />\r\n\r\nwhich is obviously wrong.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds `Variant` to the list without handling the wrong `Nil` option.\r\n\r\nA fix should happen in `_find_build_in_variants` which is responsible for adding variant types. \r\n\r\n<sub>Don't be confused by the special case for `Nil` in `_find_build_in_variants` which converts it to `null`. That's an erroneous codepath. This method should not be resposible for adding `null`. There is other code to handle this.</sub>","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359758249","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359758249"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-21T09:50:05Z","commit_id":"c66b98c9c7fcdd53c26b2f0e411c05b9b176634a"},{"id":3359799437,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IQniN","user":{"login":"mu3657","id":96520710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcDKBg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96520710?u=c2cd79aac227e7e2cbd9473ada955b579c906b8b&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657","html_url":"https://github.com/mu3657","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359799437","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359799437"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-21T10:02:53Z","commit_id":"c66b98c9c7fcdd53c26b2f0e411c05b9b176634a"},{"id":3489696417,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QAIqh","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.co